#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:82 imageeffect_blowup.cpp:101
#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:128
msgid "Blowup Photograph"
msgstr "Foto grötter maken"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:86
msgid "&Save As..."
msgstr "&Sekern as..."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:87
msgid "&Load..."
msgstr "&Laden..."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:91
msgid "<p>Reset all filter parameters to their default values."
msgstr "<p>All Parameters op ehr Standardweerten torüchsetten"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:92
msgid "<p>Load all filter parameters from settings text file."
msgstr "<p>All Filterparameters ut Text-Instellendatei laden"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:93
msgid "<p>Save all filter parameters to settings text file."
msgstr "<p>All Filterparameters na Text-Instellendatei sekern"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:103
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to blowup a photograph."
msgstr "En digiKam-Moduul för't Gröttermaken vun Fotos."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:109
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor un Pleger"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:112
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "\"CImg\"-Bibliotheek"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:115
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "Torüchmellen un Moduul-Överarbeiden"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:121
msgid "Plugin Handbook"
msgstr "Moduul-Handbook"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:138
msgid "New Size"
msgstr "Nieg Grött"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:146
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "Nettsiet vun de \"CImg\"-Bibliotheek besöken"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:148
msgid "Width:"
msgstr "Breed:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:152
msgid "<p>Set here the new imager width in pixels."
msgstr "<p>Legg hier de niege Breed vun dat Bild in Pixels fast."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:154
msgid "Height:"
msgstr "Hööchde:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:158
msgid "<p>Set here the new image height in pixels."
msgstr "<p>Legg hier de niege Hööchde vun dat Bild in Pixels fast."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:160
msgid "Maintain aspect ratio"
msgstr "Bildproportschoon wohren"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:161
msgid "<p>Enable this option to maintain aspect ratio with new image sizes."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du de Bildproportschoon för dat niege Bild "
"wohren wullt."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:172
msgid "<p>This is the current percentage of the task completed."
msgstr "<p>Dit is dat Vörankamen för de aktuelle Opgaav in Perzent."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:179
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Weekmaken"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:181
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "Enkelheiten wohren:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:186
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features in "
"the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr ""
"<p>\"Enkelheiten wohren\" leggt de Scharpteek-Stoop för lütte Objekten binnen "
"dat Teelbild fast. Grötter Weerten maakt disse Enkelheiten scharp."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:192
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Richtenafhangigkeit:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:197
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Richtenafhangen Modifikator för Enkelheiten. Laat em lütt, vun wegen dat "
"Gauß'sche Rusen."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:201
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Weekmaken:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:206
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""
"<p>Heel Weekmaak-Stärk: Wenn de Enkelheiten-Faktor dat relative Weekmaken "
"fastleggt, un de Övergangfaktor de Richt, denn leggt de Tietschritt den "
"Heeleffekt fast."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:211
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Regelmatigkeit:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:216
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not use "
"an high value here, else the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Weert stüert de Weekmaak-Regelmatigkeit vun dat Teelbild. Bruuk hier "
"keen hogen Weert, wiel sünst dat Teelbild heel verwischt warrt."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:222
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Wedderhalen:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:227
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>Leggt fast, wo faken de Filter op dat Teelbild anwendt warrt."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:235
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Verwiedert Instellen"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:237
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Winkelschritt:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:242
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""
"<p>Leggt den Integratschoon-Winkelschritt in Graad fast, analoog to de "
"Richtenafhangigkeit."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:246
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "Integraalschritt:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:251
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>Leggt den Ruum-Integraalschritt fast. Bliev ünner 1."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:255
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "Gauß'sch:"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:260
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>Leggt de Nauigkeit vun de Gauß'sche Funkschoon fast."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:264
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "Lineaar Estemeren bruken"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:265
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr ""
"<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du dat leste Beten an Gööd rutquetschen wullt "
"(langsam)."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:268
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "Foto normaliseren"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:269
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>Maak disse Optschoon an, wenn Du dat Utgaavbild normaliseren wullt."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:465
msgid "BlowUp"
msgstr "Gröttermaken"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:490
msgid "Photograph Blowup Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Gröttermaak-Instellendatei laden"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:502
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Blowup settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" is keen Text-Instellendatei för't Gröttermaken vun Fotos."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:523
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Blowup text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich ut de Textdatei för't Gröttermaken laden."

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:532
msgid "Photograph Blowup Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Gröttermaak-Instellendatei sekern"

#: imageeffect_blowup.cpp:554
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Blowup text file."
msgstr "Instellen laat sik nich na de Textdatei för't Gröttermaken sekern."

#: imageplugin_blowup.cpp:41
msgid "Blowup..."
msgstr "Grötter maken..."

